{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07351","headline":"宿双峰寺寄卢七李十六 · 刘长卿","name":"宿双峰寺寄卢七李十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寥寥禅诵处，满室虫丝结。\n独与山中人，无心生复灭。\n徘徊双峰下，惆怅双峰月。\n杳杳暮猿深，苍苍古松列。\n玩奇不可尽，渐远更幽绝。\n林暗僧独归，石寒泉且咽。\n竹房响轻吹，萝径阴余雪。\n卧涧晓何迟，背岩春未发。\n此游诚多趣，独往共谁阅。\n得意空自归，非君岂能说。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07351.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07351","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}